      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Perséfone era la hija de Deméter, la diosa del grano y de la cosecha.",
          "en": "Persephone was the daughter of Demeter, the goddess of grain and harvest."
        },
        {
          "es": "Una mañana juntaba flores en un prado con las ninfas del mar, jóvenes diosas de las aguas.",
          "en": "One morning, she picked flowers in a meadow with the sea nymphs, young goddesses of the water."
        },
        {
          "es": "Todo era luz y calma. Su madre no estaba cerca.",
          "en": "Everything was bright and calm. Her mother was not nearby."
        },
        {
          "es": "De pronto vio una flor extraña y bellísima: un narciso con cien capullos.",
          "en": "Then she saw a strange, beautiful flower: a narcissus with a hundred blooms."
        },
        {
          "es": "Persefone estiró la mano para cortarla.",
          "en": "She reached out her hand to pick it."
        }
      ],
