      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Perséfone se llevó la semilla a la boca. Era diminuta, pero lo cambió todo.",
          "en": "Persephone put the seed in her mouth. It was tiny, but it changed everything."
        },
        {
          "es": "Las versiones difieren. En el Himno homérico, Hades la empuja a probarla. En Ovidio, ella misma come siete semillas.",
          "en": "The tellings differ. In the Homeric Hymn, Hades pushes her to taste it. In Ovid, she eats seven seeds herself."
        },
        {
          "es": "De todos modos, ya quedaba atada al mundo de los muertos.",
          "en": "Either way, she was now tied to the world of the dead."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hermes tomó las riendas y el carro de oro subió veloz hacia la luz.",
          "en": "Hermes took the reins, and the golden chariot raced up toward the light."
        }
      ],
